  "steps": [
    "Toss the prawns with the turmeric, a little chilli powder and the salt and rest for 10 minutes.",
    "Heat the coconut oil in a wide pan and add the shallots, ginger, garlic, green chillies and curry leaves.",
    "Cook on medium heat until the shallots turn golden brown.",
    "Add the tomato, remaining chilli powder and coriander powder and cook until the oil separates.",
    "Add the prawns and cook on high heat for 5 to 6 minutes, stirring, until they curl and the masala clings.",
    "Sprinkle the pepper and garam masala and toss for another minute."
  ]
